flowchart TB
    Q[Question] --> QE[Embedding model: question vector, one call]
    S[Passages of about 1,200 characters] --> PE[Embedding model: one vector per passage, once per text]
    PE --> I[(Saved vectors)]
    S --> B[Python: BM25 by stem]
    QE --> R
    I --> R
    B --> R
    R[Python: 6 closest by words, 20 closest by vector, then the rest by vector] --> F[Python: fill 30,000 characters in that order, present in text order]
    C[Python: lines chained to the question's identifiers] --> F
    F --> J[12B: one token, yes or no; unknown too for a state]
    J --> G{Python: does the answer stand?}
    G -->|yes| O[Answer, basis search]
    G -->|exists no, ranked by meaning| O
    G -->|state no| O
    G -->|anything else| N[Next path: linked component, then full read]
    classDef semantic fill:#174a58,stroke:#69d7e3,color:#f3fafb,stroke-width:2px;
    classDef program fill:#1d2842,stroke:#9ab4ee,color:#f3f6fc,stroke-width:2px;
    class QE,PE,J semantic;
    class Q,S,I,B,R,F,C,G,O,N program;
